{
  "info": {
    "name": "CRM Service — Loss Reasons",
    "description": "Causas de pérdida (`crm-service-q10`), contexto `loss-reasons`.\n\nAntes de correr nada, la app tiene que estar arriba con su pila: resolver de tenants, túnel a SQL Server en el puerto 1433 y Redis. Ver `docs/servicio/entorno_local.md`.\n\n**Dos cosas que se olvidan y dan error:**\n\n1. Todo cuelga del prefijo de servicio `/crm-service`. No existe `/loss-reasons` a secas.\n2. Toda petición necesita el tenant, por header `X-Entity-Code` o por query `?EntityCode=`. Sin él es 400, no un valor por defecto.\n\nLa carpeta **2** crea su propio registro, lo actualiza y lo borra, así que no deja basura en la base. Las carpetas **1** y **3** no escriben nada.\n\nVariables a revisar antes de correr: `baseUrl`, `entityCode` y, para el 409, `inUseId`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:53318/crm-service",
      "description": "Perfil `Api` de launchSettings. HTTPS sería https://localhost:53317/crm-service."
    },
    {
      "key": "entityCode",
      "value": "641690275906",
      "description": "Tenant. El resolver lo traduce a una cadena de conexión."
    },
    {
      "key": "readOnlyId",
      "value": "1",
      "description": "Un id que exista, solo para lecturas. En el tenant de pruebas el 1 es 'Falta de Comunicación'."
    },
    {
      "key": "lossReasonId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Lo escribe el POST de la carpeta 2. No hay que tocarlo."
    },
    {
      "key": "inUseId",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Id de una causa YA ASIGNADA a un negocio, para comprobar el 409. Hay que averiguarlo en la base; sin él, ese request se salta."
    }
  ],
  "auth": null,
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// El envelope es siempre el mismo, así que los asserts comunes viven aquí.",
          "pm.collectionVariables.set('_ignore', '');"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 · Salud y documentación",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health live",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health/live", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health", "live"] },
            "description": "No lleva tenant: es una sonda de proceso."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Health ready",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health/ready", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health", "ready"] },
            "description": "Comprueba las dependencias, incluido el resolver de tenants. Un 503 aquí explica casi cualquier fallo posterior."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 — si da 503, el resolver o Redis están caídos', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Documento OpenAPI",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["openapi", "v1.json"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const doc = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('documenta el listado bajo el prefijo', () =>",
                  "    pm.expect(doc.paths).to.have.property('/crm-service/loss-reasons'));",
                  "pm.test('el id de ruta lleva descripción', () => {",
                  "    const p = doc.paths['/crm-service/loss-reasons/{id}'].get.parameters.find(x => x.in === 'path');",
                  "    pm.expect(p.description).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1 · Lecturas (no modifican nada)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar causas",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Entity-Code", "value": "{{entityCode}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["loss-reasons"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('envelope paginado { data: { items, totalCount }, statusCode }', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.statusCode).to.eql(200);",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.items).to.be.an('array');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.totalCount).to.be.a('number');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('cada causa trae id, name e isActive', () => {",
                  "    body.data.items.forEach(x => {",
                  "        pm.expect(x.id).to.be.a('number');",
                  "        pm.expect(x.name).to.be.a('string');",
                  "        pm.expect(x.isActive).to.be.a('boolean');",
                  "    });",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('ordenado por nombre', () => {",
                  "    const names = body.data.items.map(x => x.name);",
                  "    const sorted = [...names].sort((a, b) => a.localeCompare(b, 'es'));",
                  "    pm.expect(names).to.eql(sorted);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar filtrando por texto",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Entity-Code", "value": "{{entityCode}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons?search=a",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["loss-reasons"],
              "query": [{ "key": "search", "value": "a", "description": "Filtra por Name que lo contenga. Máximo 50 caracteres." }]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const term = 'a';",
                  "pm.test('todo lo devuelto contiene el término', () =>",
                  "    pm.response.json().data.items.forEach(x =>",
                  "        pm.expect(x.name.toLowerCase()).to.include(term.toLowerCase())));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar filtrando por estado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Entity-Code", "value": "{{entityCode}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons?isActive=false",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["loss-reasons"],
              "query": [{ "key": "isActive", "value": "false" }]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('ninguna activa', () =>",
                  "    pm.response.json().data.items.forEach(x => pm.expect(x.isActive).to.be.false));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar paginado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Entity-Code", "value": "{{entityCode}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons?pageIndex=0&pageSize=2",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["loss-reasons"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "pageIndex", "value": "0", "description": "Base 0." },
                { "key": "pageSize", "value": "2", "description": "Máximo 100." }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('devuelve como mucho pageSize', () =>",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.items.length).to.be.at.most(2));",
                  "pm.test('totalCount es el total sin paginar, no el de la página', () =>",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.totalCount).to.be.at.least(body.data.items.length));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar por id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Entity-Code", "value": "{{entityCode}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons/{{readOnlyId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["loss-reasons", "{{readOnlyId}}"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 — si da 404, cambia readOnlyId por uno que exista', () =>",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('devuelve la causa pedida', () =>",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.id).to.eql(Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('readOnlyId'))));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Tenant por query en vez de header",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons?EntityCode={{entityCode}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["loss-reasons"],
              "query": [{ "key": "EntityCode", "value": "{{entityCode}}" }]
            },
            "description": "El tenant viaja por header o por query. Las dos vías tienen que funcionar."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 sin header, con el tenant en la query', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 · Ciclo completo (crea, actualiza y borra su registro)",
      "description": "Correr en orden. Escribe en la base real del tenant, pero borra lo que crea.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear causa",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Entity-Code", "value": "{{entityCode}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Postman smoke test\",\n  \"isActive\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["loss-reasons"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('devuelve el id que asignó la base', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.id).to.be.a('number').and.to.be.above(0);",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.name).to.eql('Postman smoke test');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.isActive).to.be.true;",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('lossReasonId', body.data.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "El listado ya no está rancio",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Entity-Code", "value": "{{entityCode}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["loss-reasons"] },
            "description": "El listado se cachea 3 días, así que si la causa recién creada no aparece es que [OutputCacheInvalidate] no disparó."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const id = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('lossReasonId'));",
                  "pm.test('la causa recién creada aparece — la caché se invalidó', () =>",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.items.some(x => x.id === id)).to.be.true);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Consultar la creada",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Entity-Code", "value": "{{entityCode}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons/{{lossReasonId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["loss-reasons", "{{lossReasonId}}"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('es la que se creó', () =>",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.name).to.eql('Postman smoke test'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Actualizar causa",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "X-Entity-Code", "value": "{{entityCode}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Postman smoke test (editada)\",\n  \"isActive\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons/{{lossReasonId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["loss-reasons", "{{lossReasonId}}"]
            },
            "description": "`isActive` es obligatorio. Omitirlo es 400, no un false silencioso."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('devuelve el recurso actualizado', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.name).to.eql('Postman smoke test (editada)');",
                  "    pm.expect(body.data.isActive).to.be.false;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Borrar causa",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Entity-Code", "value": "{{entityCode}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons/{{lossReasonId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["loss-reasons", "{{lossReasonId}}"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));",
                  "pm.test('sin cuerpo', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.be.empty);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "La borrada ya no está",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Entity-Code", "value": "{{entityCode}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons/{{lossReasonId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["loss-reasons", "{{lossReasonId}}"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));",
                  "pm.test('error tipado', () => {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.statusCode).to.eql(404);",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error.type).to.eql('NOT_FOUND');",
                  "});",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('lossReasonId', '');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3 · Errores y validaciones (no escriben)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Sin tenant → 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["loss-reasons"] },
            "description": "No hay tenant por defecto. Sin header ni query, la petición no se puede resolver."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "id = 0 → 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Entity-Code", "value": "{{entityCode}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons/0", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["loss-reasons", "0"] },
            "description": "400, no 404: un id mal formado es una petición inválida, no un recurso inexistente."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('el detalle señala el id', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(body.error.type).to.eql('VALIDATION');",
                  "    const d = body.error.details.find(x => x.property.toLowerCase() === 'id');",
                  "    pm.expect(d.errors).to.include('Id must be greater than 0.');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "id negativo → 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Entity-Code", "value": "{{entityCode}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons/-5", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["loss-reasons", "-5"] },
            "description": "La validación del id aplica a los tres verbos con ruta, no solo al GET."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('400 y no borra nada', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));"]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "id inexistente → 404",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Entity-Code", "value": "{{entityCode}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons/999999",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["loss-reasons", "999999"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404));",
                  "pm.test('NOT_FOUND', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.type).to.eql('NOT_FOUND'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "search de 51 caracteres → 400",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Entity-Code", "value": "{{entityCode}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/loss-reasons?search=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
